        "St John Street, Manchester",
        "One barber. One chair. Your full hour.",
        "Chair and Blade is a private barber studio where only one client is seen at a time. No queue, no rush, no other chairs — just a proper cut, a sharp blade, and someone paying full attention to the job.",
        "Today's Availability",
        "10:00Open",
        "11:30Open",
        "13:00Booked",
        "14:30Open",
        "16:00Booked",
        "One studio, one barber — appointments fill quickly. Call or message to confirm a slot."
      ]
    },
