      "text": [
        "Services & Prices",
        "Every appointment is one-to-one.",
        "Prices include a consultation, hot towel finish, and as much time as the cut needs — not a fixed slot cut short.",
        "Classic Cut",
        "Scissor or clipper cut, tailored to your hair and face shape.",
        "Skin Fade",
        "Precision fade blended by hand, finished with a straight razor edge.",
        "Cut & Beard Trim",
        "Full haircut paired with a shaped, razor-lined beard trim.",
        "Beard Trim & Hot Towel Shave",
        "Beard shaping with a traditional hot towel straight-razor shave.",
        "Skin Fade with Design",
        "Fade with a hand-cut hair design or part detailing.",
        "Grey Blending / Colour",
        "Subtle tone blending for a natural, low-maintenance finish.",
        "Card and contactless only. 24 hours' notice appreciated for cancellations, since every slot is one person's full appointment."
      ]
    },
