      "text": [
        "Why One Chair",
        "The whole point is that there's only one of you at a time.",
        "01",
        "No queue, ever",
        "You book a time, and that time is yours. No sitting in a waiting area while three other cuts happen around you.",
        "02",
        "Undivided attention",
        "One barber, one client, one job at a time — nobody's cut gets rushed to keep the next chair moving.",
        "03",
        "Consistency, always",
        "You'll never turn up to find \"your barber\" isn't in. It's always the same hands on the same chair."
      ]
