        "Reviews",
        "What clients say after their first visit.",
        "★★★★★",
        "\"Best fade I've had in Manchester, and I've tried a lot of places. Having the barber's full attention for the whole appointment makes a real difference.\"",
        "James R. — St John Street regular",
        "\"No waiting around, no small talk with three other people mid-cut. Just a proper, unhurried haircut. Booked my next one before I left.\"",
        "Daniel O.",
        "\"The beard trim and hot towel shave is worth it alone. Feels like a proper old-school barber, not a quick in-and-out.\"",
        "Marcus T."
